    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "columns"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The details"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Curated library vs generated scenario."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Coelle and Caresse share the same promise — \"guidance over performance\" — but the execution sits at opposite ends."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p>\n                <h3>Listen first. Leave nothing behind.</h3>\n                <p>Before you even think about paying, you get access to pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish. No sign-up, no email, no account. You hear right away the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels. The demos don't speak your name, but they faithfully reflect what you're about to experience.</p>\n                <p>When you start a bespoke session, the AI builds a scenario from your profile: names, genders, what you want tonight, the intensity, the atmosphere. The voice names you. The scenario only ever exists for this session. Anonymous mode requires no Caresse account; purchases use your Apple or Google account.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Free audio demos, no sign-up at all (EN · FR · ES)</li>\n                    <li>No Caresse account; purchases use your Apple or Google account</li>\n                    <li>Names spoken aloud in the narration</li>\n                    <li>Duration varies with generation; exact length is not a setting</li>\n                    <li>Essentially infinite intimate-profile combinations</li>\n                    <li>Pay per session, no annual subscription</li>\n                    <li>Generated audio in EN, FR, ES and PT (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card muted"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Coelle</p>\n                <h3>An international library of guided intimacy to browse.</h3>\n                <p>Coelle advertises a guided-intimacy platform with several experience categories partners follow together in real time: warm-up, solo, couple. The library grows over time, with free articles and stories alongside it.</p>\n                <p>A good fit if you like browsing a catalog, replaying experiences you loved, and don't mind sign-up plus the annual subscription. Less of a fit if you want to listen before committing without giving an email, want a unique session with your names, or want to pay as you go.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Library of pre-designed guided experiences</li>\n                    <li>Warm-up, solo, couple categories</li>\n                    <li>Free articles and stories layer (account required)</li>\n                    <li>Annual subscription ($49.99/yr), account required</li>\n                    <li>No names or on-demand generation</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
