                "class": "price-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Caresse</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Per session</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">Free download and demos. Personalized sessions use paid credits, without a subscription.</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:0.85rem;\">Euro amounts are indicative. Prices may vary by country and store; check the amount shown in the app before purchasing.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding-top:14px;\">\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>1 experience</span>\n                        <strong>€1.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>3 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€5.49</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>5 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€7.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;\">Once generated, each experience is yours forever — available any time on your account and in the app.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">\n                    <span>Unlimited Exploration (one-time, lifetime)</span>\n                    <strong>€9.99</strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.8;\">Unlocks advanced personalization options + 1 free credit.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Coelle</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">$49.99/year</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\">Annual subscription for library access. Articles and stories remain free. Pricing recorded 17 August 2026 on the official Coelle site — check it for current terms.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-footnote"
          },
          "html": "Pricing recorded 17 August 2026 from the US App Store listing and official sites. Competitor pricing changes — verify before deciding."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "choose"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How to choose"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Honestly, who should pick what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "No spin. Here's who each app is best for."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>to listen to real audio demos before paying, no account required</li>\n                    <li>to use the app fully anonymously — no sign-up, ever</li>\n                    <li>the voice to name you and your partner</li>\n                    <li>a session that doesn't look like any other, every time</li>\n                    <li>to set intensity, practices, dirty-talk and setting</li>\n                    <li>to pay as you go instead of renewing an annual subscription</li>\n                    <li>to listen to generated sessions in English, French, Spanish or Portuguese (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval) in the same app</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Coelle if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>an international library you can browse and grow into</li>\n                    <li>to find and replay experiences you enjoyed</li>\n                    <li>a classic annual subscription with free editorial content</li>\n                    <li>editorial articles and stories around the experiences</li>\n                    <li>an established English-speaking app</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "Looking for a French-language pre-recorded catalog instead? Our comparison with <a href=\"/en/vs-melba/\">Melba</a> may help. Curious about a different generative AI approach? See <a href=\"/en/vs-inthemoment/\">Caresse vs InTheMoment</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Coelle — your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I listen to Caresse before paying, without creating an account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Caresse offers pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish, playable immediately — no sign-up, no email, no account. You hear the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels before deciding. Coelle, by contrast, requires account creation before you can discover the service."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse require an account like Coelle?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. Caresse is fully anonymous: no account creation is required to use the app, or to pay for a bespoke session. Coelle requires sign-up first. That's a structural difference that matters if you care about your privacy."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What's the main difference between Caresse and Coelle?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Coelle is a guided-intimacy platform on annual subscription: a library of pre-designed experiences both partners follow together, with mandatory account creation. Caresse generates a unique scenario every session from your profile: names spoken aloud, intensity, practices and atmosphere configured every time. Caresse also offers audio demos with no sign-up and runs 100% anonymously, in English, French and Spanish."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Coelle runs on an annual subscription — what about Caresse?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Coelle advertises an annual subscription of $49.99 (recorded 17 August 2026 on its official site). Caresse runs the opposite way: pay-per-session, no commitment, and free audio demos let you decide before any purchase. No months you pay for without using the app."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse offer a solo mode like Coelle?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes, Caresse has a native solo mode. The scenario is generated for a single profile and a single name, and remains just as personalized: practices, intensity, atmosphere, dirty-talk level."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How many different scenarios can Caresse generate vs Coelle's library?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Coelle's library has a finite set of categories. Caresse has no catalog: the combinatorial space (genders, names, practices, accessories, intensity, dirty-talk, setting, atmosphere) makes every session unique. You literally cannot replay the same thing."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse available in English like Coelle?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes — and in French and Spanish too, natively, in the same app. You pick the session language when you generate it. Coelle is English-only."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
